      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Each step adds \\(\\frac{1}{2}.\\) There are \\(100\\) steps from \\(F(1)\\) to \\(F(101),\\) so \\[ F(101)=2+\\frac{100}{2}=52. \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D.",
